        },
        {
          "_comment": "Horizontal advection u*d(tau)/dx + v*d(tau)/dy, first-order upwind, coupling each column to its four neighbors through their CURRENT ages (the age_horizontal_advection_field template; block-edge ghosts frozen at the full-field initial age, exactly zero in this run). The velocities are the linear coarse_to_fine interpolations of the block-local padded storage-grid u3_b, v3_b at the block cell. The C++ evaluates this term explicitly at the OLD time (m_A, m_A_w/e/s/n at the step start, all zero here); the harness integrates the ODE continuously, so the term as written grows over the step as the age field develops -- the measured horizontal contribution to the asserted age_storage is pinned in the tests. The hadv equation also runs where the block column is ice-free or above its surface; there tau is pinned at zero and the term evaluates to zero.",
          "lhs": "hadv",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "age_horizontal_advection_field",
            "bindings": {
              "tau": "tau",
              "u": "u3_b",
              "v": "v3_b"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "Interpolation of the fine solution to the storage (dump) grid: storage level k_s sits between fine levels k_s and k_s+1 with the fixed weight w = (k_s-1)/60 of the upper level (AgeModel::fine_to_coarse; exact for linear profiles and verified against the dump grid); the top storage level 61 is fine level 62 itself (the ice-free top of the domain).",
          "lhs": "age_storage",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "i",
              "j",
              "k_s"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "i"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "j"
              },
              "k_s": {
                "from": "lev_s"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "==",
                  "args": [
                    "k_s",
                    61
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "tau",
                    "i",
                    "j",
                    62
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "age_storage_interpolate",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "tau",
                        "i",
                        "j",
                        "k_s"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
